/-! ## HMC objects for Theorem 5.14 (corrected, v5 corrigendum Appendix D)

The state space is `ℝ^d` with its Euclidean (ℓ²) norm, the mass matrix is the identity
`M = I`, the momentum law is `N(0, I)`, and the target has Lebesgue density
