/-- Geometric ergodicity `(geoerg)`: there are `ρ < 1` and a `π`-a.e. finite
`M : X → [0,∞]` with `‖P^n(x, ·) - π‖_{TV} ≤ M(x) ρ^n` for every iteration count `n`. -/
def GeometricallyErgodic {d : ℕ} (P : HMCState d → Measure (HMCState d))
